Bind Npc 14430 Zone 2
Quest 424 "[Repeatable Solo] Kongaus Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Mercenary] Tales has commissioned you to hunt Kongaus. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 20 of 1300, 1350 at direction_511

Requires player level >= 45 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 1000000 experience or 1400000 with premium

direction_511 = location "Konga" about "Konga\nDark Army`s attack squad formerly under Atilla`s command possessing exceptional Strength, Defense Power, and Immunity " found "El Morad" at 766 301 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, I heard there's a mercenary at Raon Camp who exclusively hunts monsters. You think that's true?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "I'm Russel, the monster-hunting mercenary. There's no monster in the world I can't capture. How are your monster hunting skills? Wanna learn a few tips from me? Haha..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Shall we start with simple Kongau since you don't look too sharp? You can quit if you think you won't be able to handle it."

On in_progress
    Say "Is that the best you can do? What a joke."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_511

On ready
    Say "You underestimated my master... this is a piece of cake!! Don't flinch. Let's go get our reward!!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Hmm... you hunted them faster than I thought. Here's a valuable body armor as reward. It might be too lavish for you, haha..."
